<title>USA: Riser Foods in talks with another chain.</title>
<headline>Riser Foods in talks with another chain.</headline>
<dateline>BEDFORD HEIGHTS, Ohio 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Riser Foods Inc said Friday it was discussing a potential business combination with another supermarket chain.</p>
<p>Riser said no agreement had been reached and there could be no assurance that a deal would be completed.</p>
<p>It said it would release further details if a deal were reached.</p>
</text>
